<https://w3id.org/modavis/vao/vocab/unit/midi-tick> a qudt:Unit ;
  rdfs:label "MIDI tick"@en ;
  rdfs:comment "One discrete coordinate tick in a pulses-per-quarter-note musical timebase."@en .
<https://w3id.org/modavis/vao/vocab/unit/midi-tick-per-quarter-note> a qudt:Unit ;
  rdfs:label "MIDI ticks per quarter note"@en ;
  rdfs:comment "The pulses-per-quarter-note resolution of a musical timebase; tempo conversion is supplied by synchronization mappings rather than this rate."@en .

